Package: asb
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, acl, sudo, passwd
Maintainer: Colin Campbell <coder@colin.geek.nz>
Homepage: https://github.com/geeknz/asb
Description: Run AI coding agents in kernel-enforced sandboxes
 asb runs AI coding agents (Claude Code, Hermes, ...) as dedicated
 locked-down OS accounts. Project access is granted per directory with
 POSIX ACLs, so the kernel - not application config - enforces what an
 agent can read or write.
